  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">FEP:CH-L1047 Apoyo Institucional del Transporte Urbano</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEF:CH-L1047 Institutional Strengthening of Urban Transport</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Financiar actividades enmarcadas en una estrategia integral de mejora del transporte urbano en el rea metropolitana de Santiago y el resto del pas. La FAPEP financiar actividades de preparacin y anlisis del Programa de Apoyo a la Reforma del Transporte Urbano (CH-L1047) y de una operacin sin garanta soberana de apoyo al Sistema Transantiago (CH-L1052).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide financing to activities included in the context of a comprehensive strategy to improve the transit system of the metropolitan area of Santiago and the rest of the country. The PPF will finance preparation and analysis activities for the Support Program to the Urban Transport Reform (CH-L1047) and the non-sovereign guaranteed operation for the Transantiago system (CH-L1052).</narrative>
  </description>
